{number: 115}
{title: The Light of the World Is Jesus}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
The [C] whole world was lost in the darkness of sin,
The Light of the world is [G7] Jesus!
Like [C] sunshine at noonday, His glory shone in;
The [C] Light of the [G7] world is [C] Jesus!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Come to the [F] light, 'tis shining for [C] thee;
Sweetly the [Am] light has [D7] dawned upon [G7] me;
Once I was [C] blind, but now I can see:
The [C] Light of the [G7] world is [C] Jesus!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
No [C] darkness have we who in Jesus abide;
The Light of the world is [G7] Jesus!
We [C] walk in the light when we follow our Guide;
The [C] Light of the [G7] world is [C] Jesus!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
Ye [C] dwellers in darkness with sin-blinded eyes,
The Light of the world is [G7] Jesus!
Go, [C] wash at His bidding, and light will arise;
The [C] Light of the [G7] world is [C] Jesus!
{end_of_verse}
